        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-6632, 18 Inch Newbury Collection Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18 Inch Newbury Appliance Pull is great for transitional homes. It has a timeless design that looks stunning in almost any setting. The 18 Inch Newbury Collection Appliance Pull is perfect for heavy duty sub-zero refrigerators. Choose from a wide array of finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AP-PH-6632 Newbury Collection Appliance Pull is not just for refrigerators. Add a cohesive and look throughout your kitchen by adding them to every appliance in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-131\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-timeless-newbury-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6631\"><b>Matching 12 Inch Newbury Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 18\" Newbury Collection Appliance Pull:\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
